<TITLE>Cool Air Intake</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A porous duct<HINTREF     REFID = "H478010253A31501"/> has been adopted for the lightweight resin cool air intake, achieving high quietness without using a low-frequency resonator.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The core wire of the porous duct is made of resin, with consideration for disposal.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The air intake inlet has a funnel shape to reduce intake resistance.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<HINT>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT ID = "H478010253A31501">Perforated duct. Intake noise is reduced because the holes provide a high sound-deadening effect.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></HINT>
